      "short": "Painted portrait of a bearded man in a patterned jacket against a speckled blue-green background, using thick, visible brushstrokes.",
      "long": "A bust-length portrait of a man with fair skin, a full reddish-orange beard and mustache, and light-colored eyes looking directly at the viewer. His hair is light and receding. He wears a dark, textured jacket with flecks of red, green, and blue, featuring a collar with vertical blue-and-white stripes, over a white shirt with a pale blue inner lining visible at the neck. The background is densely built from small, energetic dabs and strokes of blue, green, orange, and white, giving it a shimmering, almost vibrating quality. The entire surface shows pronounced impasto and directional brushwork.",
